OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies week after being found
OL,4,Aseriously injured
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died a week after he was
OL,7,Ffound seriously injured at a property
OL,8,Fin Lincolnshire.
OL,10,FDr Richard Thorpe, 72, was found at the
OL,11,Fpremises on Kirkby Lane in Kirkby on
OL,12,FBain on Saturday 24 October and died in
OL,13,Fhospital on 31 October, said
OL,14,FLincolnshire Police.
OL,16,FDaniel Kent, 43, of Broad Lane,
OL,17,FSutterton, near Boston, appeared at
OL,18,FLincoln Magistrates' Court on 28
OL,19,FOctober charged with attempted murder
OL,20,Fand was remanded in custody until a
OL,21,Fhearing at Lincoln Crown Court on 25
OL,22,FNovember.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
