OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies week after being found
OL,4,Aseriously injured
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice said they were following
OL,7,F"multiples lines of enquiry to
OL,8,Festablish the full circumstances
OL,9,Fsurrounding Dr Thorpe's death" in what
OL,10,Fthey described as "a significant
OL,11,Finvestigation".
